Yejian source engine (crate `yejian-sources`)
==============================================

This crate is extracted from the Rust Aidoku WebAssembly host that ships with
Mangayomi v0.9.96, originally located at:

    app/rust/src/aidoku_wasm/   (source snapshot commit 39381ba)

The extracted modules keep their original structure and behaviour where the
host ABI requires it (HTML/CSS host functions, postcard codec, WASM models and
the interpreter loop). Changes made for this crate: Flutter Rust Bridge macros
and Dart callbacks were removed, HTTP is executed natively with `reqwest`
instead of being delegated to Dart, and each source runs on its own background
thread behind a plain Rust async API. Safety additions on top of the original
host: a per-call WASM fuel budget (runaway loops return an explicit error) and
a 64 MiB response-body cap.

Upstream project: Mangayomi (https://github.com/kodjodevf/mangayomi)
License: Apache License 2.0 — see LICENSE in this directory.

The engine executes third-party Aidoku source packages supplied by the user.
No source package, source list, or third-party site content is bundled with
this crate.
